OL,3,GNEWSAEngland's mayors to be given power
OL,4,Ato introduce tourist tax
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut ministers are said to believe
OL,7,Fmayors are unlikely to make it too
OL,8,Fexpensive with budget holidays
OL,9,Fprotected by the fact it is not a flat
OL,10,Ffee.
